{
  "info": {
    "name": "Nakra API",
    "description": "Nakra restaurants/menu API.\n\nHow to use:\n1. Import this collection + \"Nakra - Local\" environment, select the environment (top right).\n2. In the environment, set superadminPassword (same as SUPERADMIN_PASSWORD in backend/.env).\n3. Start the backend: npm run local\n4. Run \"Login as superadmin\" first. Every request that creates something saves its id (restaurantId, categoryId, ...) automatically.\n\nTokens: {{token}} = superadmin, {{adminToken}} = new admin, {{ownerToken}} = restaurant owner.\nImage requests (form-data): pick a file in the Body tab before sending.\nYou can also run the whole collection in order with the Runner (image requests are skipped automatically if no file is chosen).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "ownerToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "adminId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "adminSetupToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "resetToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "restaurantId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "restaurantSlug",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "categoryId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "category2Id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "itemId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "item2Id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "categoryIdsJson",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "itemIdsJson",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "inviteToken",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Health",
      "description": "Is the server up? No login needed.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('success (2xx)', () => pm.response.to.be.success);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "description": "Login, current user, forgot / reset password.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login as superadmin",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
            "description": "Saves the token in {{token}}. All staff requests use it automatically.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{superadminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{superadminPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('success (2xx)', () => pm.response.to.be.success);",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Me (current user)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('success (2xx)', () => pm.response.to.be.success);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login with wrong password (expect 401)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{superadminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"wrong-password\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password",
            "description": "Sends a reset link by email (or prints it in the backend terminal if SMTP is not set).\nCopy the last part of the link (after /reset-password/) into the collection variable resetToken, then use the two requests below.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{superadminEmail}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('success (2xx)', () => pm.response.to.be.success);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset password: check link",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password/{{resetToken}}",
            "description": "Needs {{resetToken}} from the forgot-password email/console.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('resetToken')) { console.warn('Skipped: set the resetToken variable first'); pm.execution.skipRequest(); }"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('success (2xx)', () => pm.response.to.be.success);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset password: set new password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password",
            "description": "Sets a new password and logs out all other sessions of that user. Returns a new token.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{resetToken}}\",\n  \"password\": \"NewPassword123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('resetToken')) { console.warn('Skipped: set the resetToken variable first'); pm.execution.skipRequest(); }"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('success (2xx)', () => pm.response.to.be.success);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Admins (superadmin only)",
      "description": "Uses {{token}} (superadmin).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List admins",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admins"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('success (2xx)', () => pm.response.to.be.success);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Create admin",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admins",
            "description": "Creates the admin and emails him a \"set your password\" link (also returned as setupLink).\nSaves adminId and adminSetupToken.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('success (2xx)', () => pm.response.to.be.success);",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('adminId', j.user.id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('adminSetupToken', j.setupLink.split('/').pop());"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Admin: check setup link",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password/{{adminSetupToken}}",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('success (2xx)', () => pm.response.to.be.success);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Admin: set password from setup link",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password",
            "description": "What the new admin does from the email link. Saves {{adminToken}}.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{adminSetupToken}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('success (2xx)', () => pm.response.to.be.success);",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', j.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Admin: login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('success (2xx)', () => pm.response.to.be.success);",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', j.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Admin: tries to list admins (expect 403)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admins",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{adminToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('403', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Resend admin setup link",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admins/{{adminId}}/resend-setup"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('success (2xx)', () => pm.response.to.be.success);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Restaurants",
      "description": "Uses {{token}} (staff). Owners can use the same requests on their own restaurant.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create restaurant (JSON, no logo)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/restaurants",
            "description": "Required: name, ownerName, and email or phone.\nOptional: slug (menu link part), instapayLink, vodafoneCashNumber, vodafoneCashInstapayLink.\nSaves restaurantId and restaurantSlug.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Cafe Nile\",\n  \"ownerName\": \"Ahmed Ali\",\n  \"email\": \"{{ownerEmail}}\",\n  \"phone\": \"01012345678\",\n  \"instapayLink\": \"https://ipn.eg/S/cafenile/instapay/abc123\",\n  \"vodafoneCashNumber\": \"01012345678\",\n  \"vodafoneCashInstapayLink\": \"\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('success (2xx)', () => pm.response.to.be.success);",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('restaurantId', j.restaurant.id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('restaurantSlug', j.restaurant.slug);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Create restaurant with logo (form-data)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/restaurants",
            "description": "Pick a logo file in Body > form-data first. Does not change the saved restaurantId.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "logo",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": "Choose an image (JPG / PNG / WEBP, max 3 MB)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "name",
                  "value": "Pizza Corner",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false
                },
                {
                  "key": "ownerName",
                  "value": "Mona Hassan",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false
                },
                {
                  "key": "email",
                  "value": "",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false
                },
                {
                  "key": "phone",
                  "value": "01112345678",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false
                },
                {
                  "key": "slug",
                  "value": "",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "Optional custom link, e.g. pizza-corner"
                },
                {
                  "key": "instapayLink",
                  "value": "",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false
                },
                {
                  "key": "vodafoneCashNumber",
                  "value": "",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false
                },
                {
                  "key": "vodafoneCashInstapayLink",
                  "value": "",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": false
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('success (2xx)', () => pm.response.to.be.success);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "List restaurants",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/restaurants"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('success (2xx)', () => pm.response.to.be.success);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get restaurant (details + menu)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}",
            "description": "Also saves the current category / item order (used by the reorder requests)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('success (2xx)', () => pm.response.to.be.success);",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "const cats = j.restaurant.categories;",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('categoryIdsJson', JSON.stringify(cats.map(c => c.id)));",
                  "const cat = cats.find(c => c.id === pm.collectionVariables.get('categoryId'));",
                  "if (cat) pm.collectionVariables.set('itemIdsJson', JSON.stringify(cat.items.map(i => i.id)));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Update restaurant (JSON)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}",
            "description": "Send only the fields you want to change. Send \"\" to clear an optional field.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Cafe Nile - Zamalek\",\n  \"vodafoneCashInstapayLink\": \"https://ipn.eg/S/vfcash/instapay/xyz\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('success (2xx)', () => pm.response.to.be.success);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
